A '''skyscraper''' of the [[New Republic]] was located on [[Coruscant]] during the [[New Republic Era]]. The [[skyscraper]] was bulky in design, and featured three large flags near the apex of the building that depicted a [[sigil of the New Republic]]. The skyscraper was part of a complex that included the [[Defense Council building|headquarters]] of the [[Senate Defense Council]], as the two were built side by side and directly connected with each other. A [[parole office]] was located within for members of the [[New Republic Amnesty Program]].<ref name="Chapter 19" /> The building was similar in design to [[New Republic Coruscant skyscraper (Tuttle's office)|that]] housing [[Colonel]] [[Tuttle]]'s office<ref name="Chapter 21">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 21: The Pirate}}</ref> as well as a [[Congenial Archive|New Republic archival office]].<ref name="Chapter 19" />

